--- !u!114 &6514718721641874525
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2861835305141051736}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: German
    Text: "Bewegen Sie das Headset nach unten und nach oben bis der Text klar zu
      erkennen ist.\n\nWenn Sie fertig sind, k\xF6nnen Sie die unten stehende Schaltfl\xE4che
      aufrufen."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: 'Move the headset up and down until you can see this text clearly.


      When
      you are ready, look at the button below to begin.'
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "D\xE9placez le casque de haut en bas jusqu'\xE0 ce que vous puissiez voir
      ce texte clairement. \\n\\n\n\nLorsque vous \xEAtes pr\xEAt, regardez le bouton
      ci-dessous pour commencer."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: "Sposta l'auricolare su e gi\xF9 fino a quando non puoi vedere chiaramente
      questo testo. \\n\\n\n\nQuando sei pronto, guarda il pulsante in basso per
      iniziare."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Polish
    Text: "Przesuwaj gogle na g\u0142owie w g\xF3r\u0119 i w d\xF3\u0142, a\u017C
      zobaczysz ten tekst wyra\u017Anie."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
